# #388: Visible off hides the node and its whole subtree in the editor's
# viewport, as in the game. The platformer's level: the pause menu (hidden;
# its shade and buttons visible) isn't drawn over the level; a selected
# hidden node keeps a faint outline; shown, its children draw.
# drive: project templates/platformer
wait 5
key escape
dblclick @asset:scenes/level1.scene.json
wait 10
hover @viewport
key shift+home
wait 1
expect node:PauseMenu.visible == false
expect node:Shade.visible == true
expect node:Shade.drawn == false
expect node:Resume.drawn == false
screenshot level_menu_hidden
click @hier:PauseMenu
wait 1
screenshot hidden_selected
click @insp.visible
wait 1
expect node:PauseMenu.visible == true
expect node:Shade.drawn == true
screenshot menu_shown
